00:31:39.180 --> 00:31:42.120
You can also see
all of the instances

00:31:42.120 --> 00:31:44.460
when this has happened,
as well as this

00:31:44.460 --> 00:31:45.890
will have time correlations.

00:31:45.890 --> 00:31:48.534
So you can see, hey, maybe
this only started two days ago.

00:31:48.534 --> 00:31:50.700
Is there something that we
