00:32:59.230 --> 00:33:00.730
And so you can
actually see, we have

00:33:00.730 --> 00:33:03.290
a ton of different functions.

00:33:03.290 --> 00:33:05.590
For instance, how much
memory each function is using

00:33:05.590 --> 00:33:08.260
and how many times
